      "The kit's client modules are published only where they are on this list (scripts/pack-manifest.mjs): the kit builds them module by module, with their declarations and stylesheets, for a product's bundler (config/tsconfig.kit-client.json, `@mistriwork/kit/vite`). An `importers` table (a product to the paths its imports are read from) is read only where those paths are in this tree, so nothing here comes off the list for want of an importer.",
      "Removing a name is a breaking change for the host: it is a deliberate edit to this list, in a release that says so in CHANGELOG.md (docs/boundary.md, \"The host list\")."
